  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">APK Cereal Bank and Sheep Breeding Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to provide a working capital fund to expand a sheep breeding project that will benefit the women in the organization. The funds will be used to construct a cereal bank;and for working capital to purchase an initial stock of cereals to improve the food security in member villages. Training to build financial and organization management capacity will also be provided</narrative>
  </description>
